@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@email = cart-user@example.com
@password = Password123
@onSaleProductId = 1
@soldOutProductId = 45
@notFoundProductId = 999999

### 1. 회원가입 - 장바구니 테스트 회원 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "name": "CartTester",
  "phone": "010-1234-5678"
}

### 2. 로그인 - accessToken 저장
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 3. 장바구니 상품 추가 성공 - 신규 상품 담기
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/carts/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "productId": {{onSaleProductId}},
  "quantity": 2
}

### 4. 장바구니 상품 추가 성공 - 같은 상품 수량 증가
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/carts/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "productId": {{onSaleProductId}},
  "quantity": 3
}

### 5. 실패 - 인증 토큰 없음
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/carts/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": {{onSaleProductId}},
  "quantity": 1
}

### 6. 실패 - 상품 ID 누락
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/carts/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "quantity": 1
}

### 7. 실패 - 수량 1 미만
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/carts/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "productId": {{onSaleProductId}},
  "quantity": 0
}

### 8. 실패 - 존재하지 않는 상품
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/carts/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "productId": {{notFoundProductId}},
  "quantity": 1
}

### 9. 실패 - 판매중이 아닌 상품
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/carts/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "productId": {{soldOutProductId}},
  "quantity": 1
}

### 10. 실패 - 재고 초과
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/carts/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "productId": {{onSaleProductId}},
  "quantity": 999999
}
